%% M9 sequence: a customer changes notification preferences.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant W as Next.js BFF
    participant G as api-gateway
    participant NS as notification-service
    participant DB as MongoDB notifications
    C->>W: open notification preferences
    W->>G: GET /api/v1/notifications/preferences
    G->>NS: forward (JWT valid)
    NS->>DB: find by userId (token subject)
    DB-->>NS: preferences, or defaults
    NS-->>W: 200 channels and statuses
    C->>W: untick SMS, keep Delivered alerts, save
    W->>G: PUT /api/v1/notifications/preferences
    G->>NS: forward
    NS->>NS: validate channels and statuses
    NS->>DB: upsert notification_preferences
    NS-->>W: 200 saved
    Note over NS,DB: the next parcel event only reaches the channels and statuses chosen here
